  "expectation": "A list whose direct children (seen through <slot> into assigned content) include\nanything other than list items (<li> or role=\"listitem\" without another role),\n<script> or <template> fails: the list announces items, and the stray child is\nread outside the item structure (H48, HTML list content model). Fires once per\nlist, located at the list. A list with another explicit role (none,\npresentation, menu, listbox) is not a list. Lists not rendered or under\naria-hidden=\"true\" are not in the accessibility tree and are not judged.",
